WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:06.370
Onii-chan.

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:06.900
Hm?

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.270
Today's an all-day training session, okay?

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:11.600
<i>"All-day," huh?</i>

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.550
After all, we're running out of time.

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.910
<i>That's true. There's no time left.</i>

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.660
<i>Is it even </i>possible<i> for me 
to get little sister moe?</i>

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:23.660
<i>You don't understand little sister moe.</i>

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.080
<i>If I don't get my act together,</i>

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:27.880
<i>the studio will change her story.</i>

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:30.820
<i>That would end up making Suzuka sad.</i>

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:33.670
<i>I need to work hard for her sake, too.</i>

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:34.770
Onii-chan.

00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:36.760
When you're done eating, first we'll—

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.510
Good morning, you two.

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:42.440
G-Good morning.

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:44.650
Good morning, Minazuki-san.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.190
Why are you hugging him?!

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:54.290
Hey, Onii-chan.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:57.140
Wanna come on my radio show?

00:00:57.830 --> 00:00:58.490
Huh?

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:35.670
Episode 9: Our Special Training at the Theme Park

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:33.000
Literary Broadcast

00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:37.060
Okay, we're going live.

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:39.760
Three, two, one...

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:46.130
Hello! Welcome to cubicle of sakura!

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:48.920
Our guest today is the author 
of the popular light novel series,

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:53.650
"This is the Tale of a Little Sister Who 
Loves Her Brother Too Much to Cope":

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:55.780
Towano Chikai-sensei!

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:58.780
I-It's a pleasure to be here. 
I'm Towano Chikai.

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:01.820
<i>So I'm counting on you, Onii-chan!</i>

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:06.800
<i>Onii-chan needs to do his special training. 
He doesn't have time to be on your radio show.</i>

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:09.520
<i>No, Suzuka, I think I will.</i>

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:10.500
<i>Onii-chan!</i>

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:12.350
<i>This is training.</i>

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:15.580
<i>I need to show a huge audience 
that I find little sisters moe.</i>

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:17.000
<i>It will all be an act, of course,</i>

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:20.310
<i>but if we flirt enough 
to forget we're pretending,</i>

00:03:20.310 --> 00:03:23.100
<i>I'll be able to tell myself 
that I find little sisters moe.</i>

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:25.390
<i>Sakura, you don't mind 
if Suzuka joins us, right?</i>

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:26.930
<i>No, of course not.</i>

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:29.870
<i>F-Flirting with Onii-chan...</i>

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:32.070
<i>Flirting in front of so many people...</i>

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:33.810
<i>Flirting...</i>

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:34.700
<i>Now we all get to go on the radio!</i>

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:39.280
And we have another special 
guest here with us today!

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:40.360
Introduce yourself.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:41.330
Nice to be here.

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:43.040
I'm Towano Chikai's little sister.

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:47.990
Having Sensei on the show is 
awesome enough on its own,

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:51.800
but having his little sister here, too? 
We're in seventh heaven here, folks!

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:54.340
So please stay tuned for the whole show!

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:58.800
Now, let's get on with the interview.

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:02.690
So, Sensei, what made you write this series?

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:03.930
<b>Towano Chikai (Start with your reasons)</b>

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:03.930
Onii-chan

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:03.930
Well, because I love little sisters, of course.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:03.930
<b>What made you 
write this series?</b>

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:04.550
<b>Towano Chikai (Start with your reasons)</b>

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:04.550
Onii-chan

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:04.550
Well, because I love little sisters, of course.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:04.550
<b>What made you 
write this series?</b>

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:06.340
<b>Towano Chikai (Start with your reasons)</b>

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:06.340
Onii-chan

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:06.340
Well, because I love little sisters, of course.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:06.340
<b>What made you 
write this series?</b>

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:07.260
<i>Onii-chan.</i>

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:08.150
<i>Huh?</i>

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:10.220
<i>I wrote down some example answers.</i>

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:13.330
<i>Please use what I've written 
here as your answers.</i>

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:14.700
<i>Thank you, Suzuka.</i>

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:19.440
Sensei, if you go all silent, 
this'll end up on the blooper reel.

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:21.550
<i>This is training, too.</i>

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:24.010
<i>I need to fully inhabit Towano Chikai.</i>

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:28.000
Well, because I love 
little sisters, of course.

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:31.230
I love them so much that
 just loving them didn't cut it,

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:34.870
so I decided to express 
my feelings through my work.

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:40.380
I see! So what's foremost in your mind 
when you're writing this novel?

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:42.620
My love for my little sister, I guess?

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:45.380
Yes, my love for my little sister.

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:47.500
Why'd you say that twice?

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:50.080
Oh, um...

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:54.140
So what is a normal day like for you?

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:56.850
I get up in the morning 
and flirt with my little sister,

00:04:57.460 --> 00:04:59.900
and at night, I dream about my little sister.

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:02.470
Wow, you just cut to the chase, don'tcha?

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:06.160
So you're saying you flirt 
with your <i>real</i> little sister?

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:08.800
Is that even a question?

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:11.930
Sounds like it wasn't even 
worth asking that one.

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:16.130
O-Okay, now I'll fire some 
standard questions at you.

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:18.380
What's your favorite thing to eat?

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.440
My little sister...

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:20.420
Your little sister?!

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:24.000
Oh, sorry, I meant my 
little sister's cooking.

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:26.180
Since I love her.

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:28.250
Wh-What do you mean by that?

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:31.180
You're acting a bit out 
of the ordinary, Sensei...

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:33.760
Hello, Sensei?

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:34.790
What's the matter?

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:38.440
Oh, I'm sorry, I was just 
admiring my little sister.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.850
You see her day in, day out,

00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:43.190
so why are you admiring her here, too?

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:47.700
Why? Because my little sister's
 a cutie pie, obviously.

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:49.010
Wow...

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:51.450
Oh, I need to answer the question.

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:56.400
Were you asking me what 
makes my little sister so cute?

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:57.960
No, I didn't ask that.

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:00.710
It's because she's <i>my</i> little sister.

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:04.420
Wh-What's gotten into you, Sensei?

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:08.400
It looks like Onii-chan only has eyes for me.

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:11.620
Why do you sound so happy?

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:16.660
Minazuki-san, I'm running 
low on "little sister energy,"

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:17.940
so I'm gonna get a refill, okay?

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:19.650
"Little sister energy"?

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:24.550
Huh?!

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:28.210
By the way, I often write with my 
little sister in my lap like this,

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:30.950
so I can replenish my stores
 of little sister energy.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:34.950
H-Hold on, Sensei! Do you 
really write in that position?

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:36.290
Yes.

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:39.510
I can smell the scent of my little sister.

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:41.320
It's the perfect position.

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:42.710
It doesn't get any better!

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:45.330
She's so cute!

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:48.720
Her hair's so silky soft and 
my little sister's just too damn cute!

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:50.230
A total angel!

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:54.220
Sensei, we're still on-air.

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:57.680
Well, my precious little 
sister's right here, after all.

00:06:57.680 --> 00:07:01.030
It's only natural to enjoy 
the feel of her hair.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:04.720
Onii-chan, that tickles...

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:08.190
Just don't forget we're broadcasting, okay?

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:10.410
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:16.570
Well, listeners, look forward to more "Towano 
Chikai and His Little Sister's Love Nest!"

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:18.450
They've hijacked the program!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:22.920
Was that really <i>true</i> little sister moe?

00:07:24.030 --> 00:07:25.840
It didn't feel right to me.

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:31.590
Huh? That's...

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:35.160
Sakurada-san?

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:37.140
You're...

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:38.560
Towano Chikai-sensei?

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:41.310
What are you doing here?

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:44.040
N-No reason. No reason at all.

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:46.810
I'm, uh, just here about another title.

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:48.880
Now, if you'll excuse me.

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:51.420
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:53.520
Sorry we took so long.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.090
Let's head home, Onii-chan.

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:57.240
Yeah... we should.

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:00.250
Who's that?

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:02.270
So you finally made it home.

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:03.100
Mai?

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:04.750
Welcome home, Sensei!

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:07.750
Double Peace-sensei's here, too? But why?

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:10.030
We've come to hang out!

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:13.580
With this many women around, 
you've got yourself a harem!

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:15.990
I was just passing by.

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:17.980
What are <i>you</i> doing with them?

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:19.990
Oh, well, she's—

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:23.020
I'm living with Onii-chan right now.

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:25.340
"L-L-L-L-Living with"?!

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:26.960
H-Hey, Yuu!

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:29.530
Why are you ditching me 
and shacking up with her?!

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:32.470
What was Sensei like 
when the lights went out?

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:36.030
I'd like to experience 
the same things you have!

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:38.430
Calm down, you two!

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:40.610
I'll explain everything fully.

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:42.040
Good grief.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:44.870
She ran away from home, 
so you're letting her stay here?

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:48.540
I see. I didn't even consider 
trying the runaway angle.

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:51.050
It's unfair!

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:53.580
If I'd known I could've run away from home

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:55.510
and crashed here, I would've run away, too.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:57.580
Okay, I've run away from home.

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:59.400
I just ran away from home.

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:01.400
So let me stay here!

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:01.970
Huh?

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:05.910
I've run away from home, 
too, so please help me.

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:08.200
Calm down, you two.

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:11.230
Sakura <i>is</i> here because 
she ran away from home,

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:14.120
but she's also staying 
because she's helping me.

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:15.410
Helping you?

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:16.740
That's right.

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:20.740
I'm helping Sensei 
research little sister moe.

00:09:22.090 --> 00:09:23.200
It's true.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:26.870
Why didn't you just consult me, 
your biggest fan and rival?

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:28.580
Exactly, Sensei!

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:32.950
I'm your partner in crime,

00:09:32.950 --> 00:09:36.090
so of <i>course</i> I'd want to help you out.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:38.180
Thanks, I guess...

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:40.100
So I'll become your little sister, too!

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:42.120
What are you two saying?

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:44.600
I just had a brainwave.

00:09:44.990 --> 00:09:46.760
What kind of brainwave?

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:50.110
We can all pretend we're Onii-chan's 
little sisters and go on a date with him.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.160
Huh? What do you mean?

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:56.860
We'll draw lots to choose what type of little 
sister we are, and we'll go on a date with you.

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:59.570
That sounds like a wonderful "event"!

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:01.870
I'll go make the lots.

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:03.080
Nice.

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:07.370
I'll prove that I'm the one 
who can help Yuu the most.

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:09.880
Hey, don't go deciding things on your own...

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:15.380
Onii-chan, what's the meaning of this?

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:25.200
Why are these two here?

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:28.650
I got a phone call from Akino-san yesterday,

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:32.410
and when I told her about today, 
she decided to tag along.

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:35.150
I'm Towano-sensei's favorite student,

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:38.290
so it's only natural I'd help out 
with Sensei's special training.

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:39.780
"Student"?

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:44.750
I can begrudgingly accept 
Akino-san tagging along,

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:47.290
but what's Haruna-san doing here?

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:48.490
Don't ask me!

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:52.860
I'm here to keep an eye on <i>him</i> to make 
sure he doesn't try anything with my sister.

00:10:57.750 --> 00:10:58.300
<i>Huh?</i>

00:10:58.560 --> 00:11:00.430
<i>I feel like I've been here before, long ago...</i>

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:04.300
<i>I was so scared.</i>

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:09.500
<i>I thought I'd never see you again, Onii-chan.</i>

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:14.520
<i>Don't worry, I'll always...</i>

00:11:16.140 --> 00:11:17.460
<i>I can't remember.</i>

00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:21.450
Now, everyone, draw lots!

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:25.160
<i>Well, if I view this as 
training, it can only be good.</i>

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:28.640
Everyone has one, yes?

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:31.070
Now, pretend to be the 
type of little sister you got,

00:11:31.070 --> 00:11:32.920
and enjoy your date with Sensei!

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:35.420
We'll decide the order 
using rock-paper-scissors!

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:38.630
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:45.600
Suzuka, why are you with us?

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:51.880
As your little sister, it's my duty 
to oversee all of your training.

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:54.870
But you can't stand haunted houses.

00:11:54.870 --> 00:11:56.360
I-I'm fine.

00:11:57.030 --> 00:11:58.780
You don't look fine.

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.980
Also, you haven't said 
anything for a while now, Mai.

00:12:01.980 --> 00:12:03.610
Doesn't this stuff scare you?

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:07.190
I'm a "kuudere" little sister, 
so I'm killing my emotional response.

00:12:07.190 --> 00:12:10.330
Besides, fakes like these 
wouldn't scare anyone.

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:17.250
You're not kuudere at all!

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:22.840
Yay! I'm a "loli dere" little sister,

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.970
so this is my special seat.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:30.350
Double Peace-san, I'm so jeal— 
I mean, what are you playing at?!

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:37.110
Whoa! Why are you eating it like that?

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:43.780
This big, long, amazing thing 
you gave me is so delicious, Sensei.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:45.210
Phrasing!

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:47.530
You'll give people the wrong idea!

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:50.740
What are you doing, slowpoke?

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:52.350
We're taking the picture already.

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:54.150
Onii-chan, get in the photo.

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:58.660
Uh, the younger Kanzaka
pulled "tsundere" out of the hat,

00:12:58.660 --> 00:12:59.840
but what'd you get, Akino-san?

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:02.460
"Nyandere" little sister, meow.

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:04.550
"Nyandere"?

00:13:06.670 --> 00:13:08.050
Ow!

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:09.550
O-Onii-chan?

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:11.880
Hey, why did you bite me?!

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:15.310
Cats express their heartfelt
love through love bites, meow!

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:18.770
Y-You two are too close to Onii-chan!

00:13:19.220 --> 00:13:23.130
Move away... from... <i>him!</i>

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:24.240
I'm taking it now.

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:29.160
I know this is training,

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:31.650
but you're fawning over 
them too much, Onii-chan.

00:13:31.650 --> 00:13:32.580
Suzuka-san?

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:36.470
But now, it's my turn.

00:13:36.470 --> 00:13:39.080
I'll flirt with you as much as I can.

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:40.540
Onii-chan.

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:41.380
Yes?

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:42.800
Let's go already.

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:47.970
<i>It's pretty weird for my little sister 
to pretend to be my little sister.</i>

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:49.470
Come on, hurry up.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.970
<b>My Sister, 
My Writer
</b>

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:59.350
Onii-chan, you're so warm.

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:02.160
Whoa now, just hold on a sec, Suzuka.

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:03.320
What's going on?

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:08.430
"Deredere" little sister?

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:09.700
That's right.

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:13.240
So I'm going to cling to you, Onii-chan.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:15.040
Because I'm "deredere" for you.

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:19.210
It'll help your training if I act like 
a different little sister, won't it?

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:20.610
That's true.

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:24.500
I don't think you'd ever be all 
"deredere" around me, usually.

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:27.670
Stupid Onii-chan.

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:28.950
Ow!

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:30.640
But it's fine.

00:14:31.210 --> 00:14:34.120
Because I'm your "deredere" 
little sister right now.

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:38.280
So I'm being "deredere" 
as part of your training.

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:41.180
Onii-chan!

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:51.040
Suzuka-san, I wish... 
I wish you'd let go for a bit.

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:52.360
No.

00:14:52.360 --> 00:14:54.600
I'm your "deredere" little sister,

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:58.220
so I want to flirt with 
you like this forever!

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:02.330
Onii-chan, you're so warm.

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:06.090
Suzuka, could you let go for a bit, please?

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:09.760
Is it because your heart's 
going a mile a minute?

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:13.630
Yes, exactly! So cut me a break.

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:17.580
I-In that case, I have a request.

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:21.520
Do you think you could call me cute?

00:15:22.130 --> 00:15:23.490
You're cute.

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:25.040
You're <i>so</i> cute.

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:27.570
You're so cute I don't know what to do.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.530
Now, please, give me some space.

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:34.010
Thank you so much.

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:36.240
Onii-chan called me cute.

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:38.950
I'm so happy.

00:15:40.670 --> 00:15:42.740
<i>I know it's just an act,</i>

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:44.670
<i>so why is my heart pounding so hard?</i>

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:47.220
Onii-chan, have you settled down now?

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:52.680
If you've calmed down, then 
I hope you'll hug me this time.

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:55.680
No, what? You want me to?!

00:15:56.570 --> 00:15:58.800
Um, uh, ah...

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:01.560
Look, our turn on the 
Ferris wheel's almost over,

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:03.690
so we don't have time for a hug.

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:07.860
Jeez, that was a great opportunity, too.

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:09.690
An opportunity for what?

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:11.910
O-Oh, nothing.

00:16:13.560 --> 00:16:16.020
Sharing these feelings with you...

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:19.700
Onii-chan?

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:24.200
I need to go to the bathroom.

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:26.460
Okay, I'll go on ahead.

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:38.480
Huh? This place looks familiar...

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:39.710
<i>It's a promise.</i>

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:41.350
<i>Yeah, it's a promise.</i>

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:45.680
I was right. I've been here before.

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:47.360
Back then, we...

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:50.670
Is that the time?

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:52.190
I'll be late meeting up with her.

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:56.150
Huh? Who's that guy?

00:16:57.260 --> 00:17:01.380
Hey, you're that voice actress, 
Minazuki Sakura, right?

00:17:01.860 --> 00:17:03.460
Like I said, you're mistaken.

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:05.120
You're lying.

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:06.840
I can tell by your voice!

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:11.440
I recognized it as soon as I heard 
you talking to those girls over there!

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:12.420
Onii-chan!

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:14.480
Huh? Who are you?

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:16.470
That's my line.

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:18.090
Why are you pestering my little sister?

00:17:18.090 --> 00:17:19.150
Your little sister?

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:22.680
That woman is Minazuki 
Sakura-chan, the voice actress,

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:23.900
and I'm a huge fan of hers.

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:26.690
She said you were mistaken, 
so you must have the wrong person.

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:28.660
Or do you want me to call someone?

00:17:32.670 --> 00:17:33.890
Are you all right, Sakura?

00:17:33.890 --> 00:17:36.640
Thank you, Onii-chan!

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:38.450
I was so scared!

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:42.160
Oh, no, um... Are you okay?

00:17:42.550 --> 00:17:44.260
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:17:45.010 --> 00:17:47.670
You're so different from that man, Onii-chan.

00:17:48.340 --> 00:17:50.510
Hey, there's something I want to ask you.

00:17:50.510 --> 00:17:51.240
What?

00:17:51.930 --> 00:17:55.960
You write such an incredibly
 moe story about a little sister,

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:58.930
so why do you need training 
on little sister moe?

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:02.660
Well, it's like I told you before,

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:04.930
I don't really understand little sister moe.

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:07.480
Yeah, but why do you need to?

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:09.480
W-Well, you see...

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:12.940
I need everything to be
 perfect in my story, right?

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:16.440
So when something's missing, 
I feel so bad, I just can't write.

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:17.870
That's a lie, isn't it?

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:18.960
No, uh...

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:21.680
This is important, so you 
shouldn't lie to your little sister.

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:22.450
Sakura...

00:18:22.730 --> 00:18:26.960
When I see you bottling it all up, 
I get worried, Onii-chan.

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:32.460
Well, a while back, I got into an argument 
with this guy over little sister moe.

00:18:32.950 --> 00:18:36.460
He told me I didn't understand 
little sister moe at all.

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:37.620
"Little sister moe"?

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:38.220
Yeah.

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:40.710
I lost our debate on little sister moe.

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:46.180
So I need to understand little sister 
moe fully so that I can out-argue him.

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:47.970
Is that it?

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:48.360
Huh?

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:52.730
I find it hard to believe you don't 
understand little sister moe, Onii-chan.

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:55.550
What makes you think that?

00:18:55.550 --> 00:18:58.110
Because that's how I used to be.

00:18:58.740 --> 00:18:59.490
What do you me—

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:02.990
Onii-chan, will you listen to my confession?

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:08.480
<i>I should confess.</i>

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:12.870
<i>I should share this deluge 
of feelings with Onii-chan.</i>

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:21.920
It used to be impossible for 
me to play little sister roles.

00:19:22.420 --> 00:19:24.470
All because my older brother 
has a sister complex.

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:28.050
Is that the brother who caused 
you to run away from home?

00:19:28.050 --> 00:19:29.230
Wait, a sister complex?

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:35.690
Yeah, my brother's love is 
kinda oppressive and irritating.

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:40.400
He's the type to say, "It's only natural
I'd worry, because you're an angel!"

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:41.240
That's...

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:42.520
I warned him off,

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:46.360
but his response was plain crazy.
 "You're cute when you're mad, too."

00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:48.460
If I ignored him, he'd start moping.

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:53.420
What do you think it was like for me, 
enduring years in that kind of environment?

00:19:55.030 --> 00:19:56.500
Awful, probably.

00:19:56.980 --> 00:19:59.070
Yes, it was awful.

00:20:00.230 --> 00:20:04.470
So I couldn't even begin to 
understand little sister moe.

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:07.370
That makes sense, given your situation.

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:10.080
My brother's sister 
complex only escalated,

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:12.980
so I went into his room to give 
him a piece of my mind and...

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:23.440
<i>Onii-tan, I love you!</i>

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:25.570
That's like something out of a nightmare.

00:20:27.170 --> 00:20:30.910
So that's why we had a huge fight
 and I ran away from home.

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:32.250
I see.

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:34.910
But if you lived with a brother 
with a sister complex,

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:37.550
what made you understand little sister moe?

00:20:37.550 --> 00:20:41.640
Duh! Because I came across
your novel, Onii-chan.

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:44.130
Suzu— I mean, my novel?

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:44.880
Yeah.

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:50.280
I seriously wanted little sister moe 
to just disappear off the face of the Earth,

00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:54.800
but thanks to your novel, 
I now find little sisters endearing.

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:58.360
So I'm ever so indebted to you.

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:01.360
<i>Who would have imagined 
Suzuka's novel had such power?</i>

00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:05.370
So I need to repay you, Onii-chan.

00:21:05.370 --> 00:21:07.370
No, don't worry about it.

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:12.680
There's something only I can do for you,
 since I used to worry about the same thing.

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:15.980
Because the answer to your 
problem is clear as day.

00:21:15.980 --> 00:21:16.880
What?

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:19.800
Onii-chan, you already
 find little sisters moe.

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:22.380
No, no, no. Me? Find little sisters moe?

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:27.530
You clearly fawned over me 
when I was in character,

00:21:27.530 --> 00:21:30.400
and when everyone calls you 
Onii-chan, you get all...

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:31.390
You're joking, right?

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:32.760
I'm serious.

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:35.510
You're saying... I really 
find little sisters moe?

00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:37.350
That's nuts.

00:21:43.390 --> 00:21:46.490
You're really kind, Onii-chan.

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:51.800
That's why I love you.

00:21:51.800 --> 00:21:56.360
I love you with all my heart.

00:21:56.360 --> 00:21:56.950
<i>Huh?</i>

00:21:57.600 --> 00:21:58.920
Onii-chan?

00:22:02.780 --> 00:22:03.780
Suzuka?

00:22:04.770 --> 00:22:05.570
Hey, Suzuka!

00:22:05.570 --> 00:22:06.420
Wait up!

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:07.590
Damn!

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:09.450
Wait, Onii-chan!

00:22:09.450 --> 00:22:12.160
Let me go! I have to go after Suzuka!

00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:14.180
You haven't given me a response yet.

00:22:15.470 --> 00:22:16.230
I'm sorry.

00:22:20.760 --> 00:22:23.960
Looks like I lost the contest, huh?

00:22:23.960 --> 00:22:24.690
Huh?

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:27.360
Jeez, Sensei!

00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:29.540
Why are you so shocked?

00:22:29.540 --> 00:22:32.200
That was all an act for our contest.

00:22:32.610 --> 00:22:34.690
Contest? An act?

00:22:34.690 --> 00:22:38.780
I'm talking about the little 
sister duel. Remember?

00:22:39.310 --> 00:22:43.710
What's more moe than a little 
sister's sudden confession, right?

00:22:44.110 --> 00:22:46.370
I see. Yeah, you're right.

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:52.720
You really are the best, Onii-chan...

00:22:53.680 --> 00:22:55.220
What do you mean by that?

00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:58.730
Forget it. You need 
to go after Suzuka-chan.

00:22:59.550 --> 00:23:00.900
You're right.

00:23:00.900 --> 00:23:02.360
Sorry, but I'm going now!

00:23:06.140 --> 00:23:10.160
I knew it. I can't beat the real deal, can I?

00:23:13.130 --> 00:23:17.260
<i>What were Sakura-san and Onii-chan doing?!</i>

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:21.700
<i>What did Sakura-san mean by that?</i>

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:40.020
Next
 episode...
 <b>is the final 
episode!!!</b>

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:40.020
Illustration: Furukawa Hironobu

00:23:25.660 --> 00:23:26.690
It's roll call today!

00:23:26.690 --> 00:23:27.380
Suzuka-chan!

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:28.000
Y-Yes?

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:28.740
Mai-chan!

00:23:28.740 --> 00:23:29.290
What?

00:23:29.290 --> 00:23:30.270
Double Peace-sensei!

00:23:30.270 --> 00:23:30.840
Yes!

00:23:30.840 --> 00:23:31.500
Sakura-san!

00:23:31.500 --> 00:23:32.020
Yes!

00:23:32.020 --> 00:23:32.810
The Kanzaka Sisters!

00:23:32.810 --> 00:23:33.710
You called?

00:23:33.710 --> 00:23:34.340
Reika-san!

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:40.020
Next Episode

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:40.020
"I Can Find My Little Sister Moe"

00:23:34.340 --> 00:23:35.010
Shinozaki here.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:36.250
Next week's the final episode.

00:23:36.250 --> 00:23:36.880
Huh?!

00:23:36.880 --> 00:23:38.110
See you next week!

00:23:38.110 --> 00:23:39.530
You didn't call my name!
